#6707
abyssal sentinel~
The Abyssal Sentinel~
The Abyssal Sentinel stands here, shimmering and flickering
with a turquoise glow.~
The sentinel stands about 18 hands high, towering over your party, a shining
beacon of turquoise in the darkness of the abyss.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
95 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 0d0+12000 0d0+200
1 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
look $n
if whichgod($n)==2
  say Be gone, Chaos scum!
  mptransfer $n 9755
else
  if whichgod($n)==0
    mpechoat $n The Sentinel says, "Lord Neptune doesn't like visitors.  If you 
    mpechoat $n must bother him, mind your step.
    mpechoat $n Say 'pass' if you wish to continue."
  else
    if whichgod($n)==1
      mpechoat $n The Sentinel says, "Lord Neptune always has time for 
      mpechoat $n  the chosen sons and daughters of Order.  I'm sure he looks 
      mpechoat $n  forward to meeting with you.
      mpechoat $n  Say 'pass' when you're ready to proceed."
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog pass~
if race($n)==7
  mpechoat $n The Sentinel looks at your party skeptically, then nods his head.
  mpechoaround $n The Sentinel looks at you skeptically, then nods his head at $n.
  mptransfer 'all' 6701
else
  if race($n)==0
    mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about humans and shifts his weight.
  else
    if race($n)==3
      mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about the drow and picks his teeth with his sword.
    else
      if race($n)==2
        mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about elves and sneers nastily.
      else
        if race($n) == 6
          mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about orc and grins evilly.
        else
          if race($n)==1
            mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about halflings and laughs mercilessly.
          else
            if race($n)==5
              mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about the gnomes and cackles with glee.
            else
              if race($n)==4
                mpecho The Sentinel mumbles something about dwarves and shrugs nonchalantly.
              endif
            endif
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
