mpecho Prialto carefully places the stone back into its place
mpecho in the hilt of the cane, unaware of your treachery.
mpjunk all
mpoload 6701
mpoload 6705
give figurine $n
mpecho Prialto raises his cane high into the sky.
mpecho You feel different...
mptransfer 'all' 6751
~
