#6723
nine lives minion9lives~
The Minion of Nine Lives~
A three-headed beast stands here, growling.~
Some say this minion has nine lives.  Judging by his enormous claws and dour
countenance, you'd guess that one would be more than enough.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
120 BODY_HEAD BODY_HEAD 0d0+14000 0d0+133
1 1179924
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 100~
if quest(20,4,$n) == 8
  mpmset $n quest 20 4 0
  mpecho The beast screams out in agony, then slides through
  mpecho the floor, leaving a gaping hole, which swallows you whole.
  mpecho The ceiling seals itself above your head.
  mptransfer 'all' 6796
else
  if quest(20,4,$n) == 7
    mpoload 6717
    mpmset $n quest 20 4 8
    say $n you are great, I have lost eight!
  else
    if quest(20,4,$n) == 6
      mpoload 6716
      mpmset $n quest 20 4 7
      say Aaaaargh!  $n, seven must be your lucky number!
    else
      if quest(20,4,$n) == 5
        mpoload 6715
        mpmset $n quest 20 4 6
        say Impossible! $n, you have won six times!
      else
        if quest(20,4,$n) == 4
          mpoload 6714
          mpmset $n quest 20 4 5
          say Damn you $n!  I have lost five times to you!
        else
          if quest(20,4,$n) == 3
            mpoload 6713
            mpmset $n quest 20 4 4
            say Four times eh $n?  Your luck will run out soon!
          else
            if quest(20,4,$n) == 2
              mpoload 6712
              mpmset $n quest 20 4 3
              say $n, you are lucky to defeat me for the third time!
            else
              if quest(20,4,$n) == 1
                mpoload 6711
                mpmset $n quest 20 4 2
                say $n, you are lucky to defeat me for the second time!
              else
                mpoload 6710
                mpmset $n quest 20 4 1
                say $n, you were lucky to defeat me once!
              endif
            endif
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>rand_prog 10~
say Fools!  You cannot defeat me, for I have nine lives!
~
|
#6724
lord neptune~
Lord Neptune~
Lord Neptune sits here upon his mighty garden throne.~
Lord Neptune has taken the form of a rather large human with a flowing grey
beard and equally flowing turquoise robes.  He looks a bit annoyed at your
intrusion, but seems willing to listen to your plight.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY
0 S
150 BODY_FOOT BODY_FOOT 0d0+22000 0d0+180
1 1810212
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>greet_prog 100~
say Greetings.  Are you here with an urgent request 
say or just for a little adventure?
~
>speech_prog request~
say Bah!  I have no time for urgent requests.  Be gone.
mpecho Lord Neptune waves his hands lazily about his head.
mpforce $n remove all
mpforce $n drop all
mpecho $n is swallowed up by a portal which is gone as suddenly
mpecho as it appeared!
mptransfer $n 6775
~
>speech_prog adventure~
say Ah, well then, it is adventure that you shall find...
mpecho Lord Neptune pauses for a moment, then
mpecho looks up with a puzzled expression on his face.
say But first...  perhaps you can help me with this puzzle 
say that Lord Order gave me.  I can't seem to make heads 
say or tails of it.  He always gets the best of me.  
say Chess, backgammon, canasta, even checkers.  But not 
say this time, damn it.  
grumble 
mpecho Lord Neptune stares off dreamily into the distance.
~
>speech_prog puzzle~
mpecho Lord Neptune looks back at you with a start.
say What's that?  You're still here?  Oh, right, the puzzle.
say Ok, it goes like this:
say ISPN HAGCHNAC FIGTE XON HFXO GP GABNA;
say PAGY SOFGC CHASTEC GTIW BNFXO.
say All he told me was that C = S
say and, frankly, I'm stumped.  Figure it out for me,
say and I'll find you some adventure.
smile $n
~
>speech_prog p life prospers along the path of order; from chaos springs only death.~
say Ahhh, yes.  A simple cryptogram.  Why didn't I think of that?
grin 
say I promised you adventure, and adventure it shall be.
say Prepare yourselves...
mpmset self quest 0 4 1
~
>rand_prog 70~
if quest(0,4,self) == 1
  mpecho Lord Neptune says, "Ready..."
  mpmset self quest 0 4 2
else
if quest(0,4,self) == 2
  mpecho Lord Neptune says, "Set..."
  mpmset self quest 0 4 3
else
if quest(0,4,self) == 3  
  wink 
  mpecho Lord Neptune moves his hand in a slight gesture, and you are gone.
  mptransfer all 6790
  mpmset self quest 0 4 0
endif
endif
endif
~
|
