#6700
A Hole in the Darkness~
The blackness of the abyss wraps you in a cold, empty cacoon.
You can see only darkness in every direction, though you can feel
that the walls of the abyss have closed in all around you, forming
a small alcove.  As you bring your lantern close to the wall for
inspection, you notice a strange rock to you left, and an indentation
to your right.~
