#6719
On the Other Side of the Cavern~
You have made it to a wall in this seemingless endless expanse of
oily black water, deep within the heart of the abyss.  The rock of
the wall is smooth to the touch, except for a series of orderly
bumps and ridges which you immediately recognize as elven braille.~
67 ROOM_DARK|ROOM_NO_RECALL SECT_UNDER_WATER
DDIR_NORTH
~
~
