E
bump ridge sign wall rock~
The path to Lord Neptune is a long and arduous one.  His Greatness
is easily annoyed by distraction and has created a series of tests
to both discourage frivolous requests and to provide entertainment
for the courtiers of his godly palace.  If you must call on His
Greatness, then say 'enter' when you are ready to proceed.~
