#6788
Neptune's Garden~
You've made it!  You are standing in a garden which glows turquoise from
deep within.  It is a garden in the sense that it resembles what a garden
might look like if it were entirely submerged in seawater, but this does
not lessen its beauty in any way.  Colorful anenomes wave their tentacles
at you, while striped fish dart in and out of fragile sponges.
Uniquely-shaped rocks have been placed in attractive patterns between the
natural-looking but well-planned rows of cultivated sea cucumbers and
crinoid fans.  You see that you are standing in a small enclosure at the
very center of the garden, which you can now see stretches to the horizon
in every direction.  Beyond the garden rise the towering turrets and
ramparts of a great castle which shines turquoise and glows brighter than
anything you have yet witnessed in your abyssal explorations.  It appears
that you may have to be happy viewing the castle from afar, as visitors
seem to be corralled toward a large daythrone just to your left.~
