Neptune's Throne~
Here amidst the shrimp and the seahorses, Lord Neptune has constructed a
mighty ornamental throne for receiving his occasional visitors.  While he
is reknowned for his love of privacy and his poor temperment, he reluctantly
shares this small part of his glorious kingdom with the few lucky souls
who survive the rite of passage he has created for them.  Perhaps he is
feeling generous or perhaps Lord Order has been admonishing him lately to
be more generous with his time, but you are humbled by the flowing robes
and even longer beard of the mortal form Lord Neptune has taken to so
graciously appear before you today.~
