The Dark Shrine~
This small chamber is dominated by an effigy to Lord Chaos, charred black
over the eons by excessive use of burnt offerings.  The altar below the
effigy is blocky and bare, ornamented only by a series of strange grooves
running down and away from the top surface.  What function could they have
possibly served?~
